tool.liquify.name = Liquify
tool.liquify.description = Panahia, takahurihia, whakawhāitihia, whakarahihia rānei ngā pika i raro i tētahi paraihe nui — mā te kōwhiringa aratau e tīpako te mahi. Ka whakaemihia te whakakōpiko ki tētahi mata, ā, ka hoatu ki te apa ina whakaūngia.
