tool.puppet_warp.description = Pāwhiria hei titi i te apa ki ētahi ira, kātahi ka tōia tētahi: ka piko te mata huri noa i ngā titi, he mārō, he ngāwari rānei e ai ki te kōwhiringa Mārō. Mā te whakaū e hoatu ai.
